     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation Hendelse-Anfall-1</b></p><a name=\"Hendelse-Anfall-1\"> </a><a name=\"hcHendelse-Anfall-1\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-jodacare-hendelse-anfall.html\">Hendelse: Anfall</a></p></div><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsestype anfall}\">Anfall</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-Tjenestemottaker-Ida.html\">Ida Testvik  Female, DoB: 2013-03-13 ( urn:oid:2.16.578.1.12.4.1.4.1#Foedselsnummer#13031353453)</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2026-11-08 02:14:00+0100 --&gt; 2026-11-08 02:17:00+0100</p><p><b>performer</b>: <a href=\"Practitioner-Ansatt-Ahmed.html\">Ahmed Testesen</a></p><p><b>note</b>: </p><blockquote><div><p>Ida sovnet igjen kl. 02.40. Hun kan være trøtt på skolen i dag.</p>\n</div></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsesfelt anfallstype}\">Anfallstype</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-svar-anfall-anfallstype tonisk-klonisk}\">Tonisk-klonisk</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsesfelt varighet_minutter}\">Varighet (minutter)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 3 min<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemin = 'min')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsesfelt bevissthet}\">Bevissthet under anfall</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-svar-anfall-bevissthet nei}\">Nei</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsesfelt alvorlighetsgrad}\">Alvorlighetsgrad</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-alvorlighetsgrad-anfall moderat}\">Moderat</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsesfelt nodmedisin_gitt}\">Nødmedisin gitt?</span></p><p><b>value</b>: false</p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://kristilerla.github.io/jodacare-hendelseslogg-fhir/CodeSystem/jodacare-hendelsesfelt hva_skjedde_etter}\">Hva skjedde etter</span></p><p><b>value</b>: Lagt i sideleie. Var urolig i ca. 10 minutter etterpå.</p></blockquote></div>"
